    ("for await", "`for await (const x of stream)` consumes async iterables sequentially — paginated APIs and file lines elegantly."),
    ("Promise.allSettled results", "Inspect `.status` per result (`fulfilled`/`rejected`) for bulk jobs where partial success is the norm."),
