    ("structuredClone limits", "Clones most builtins but not functions/DOM nodes — know the boundary before trusting deep copies."),
    ("ArrayBuffer views", "Typed arrays (`new Uint8Array(buf)`) + DataView parse binary protocols; endianness flags matter here."),
    ("WeakMap WeakSet", "Weak collections hold ephemerally (metadata keyed by objects) and never block garbage collection."),
