    ("pgbouncer pooling", "PgBouncer transaction-pooling multiplexes thousands of app connections into tens of server ones; prepared statements need care in transaction mode."),
    ("\\pset null pager", "`\\pset null '[kosong]'` marks NULLs visibly; `\\pset pager off` streams huge results without `less` traps."),
